{"narration":"You eat a travel ration in the Copper Lantern’s quiet loft, then ease yourself down to sleep. Tonight, there is no need to keep watch.

Eight undisturbed hours carry you into morning. Pale light reaches the loft as you wake; some soreness remains, but moving takes less effort than it did last night.

Long rest complete. HP: 10/12. Travel rations remaining: 2.","visualDescription":"Cinematic noir, 16:9: Rowan resting in the secure tavern loft, travel pack nearby. Night’s deep shadows give way to soft grey morning light, revealing a quiet, unhurried waking.","clarification":null}
